                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The current heat wave has Texas set to be hotter than 99% of the world this week. Yet, the radical Republicans running our state are denying workers water breaks in this heat.\n\nSuch callous, inhumane treatment doesn\u2019t reflect who we are as Texans. If you\u2019re ready to elect new leadership that reflects our values, join us at https://t.co/gjUD12Q3Qe.",
